WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.002
Leave immersion at any time.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:10.796
Use the persistent Exit Simulation control whenever you feel uncomfortable or want to return to the shared-space dashboard.

00:00:10.796 --> 00:00:18.947
Learning progress is not treated as clinical performance merely because an immersive session was opened or closed.
